{"product_id":"earth-attack","title":"Earth Attack!","description":"\u003cp\u003eUnbelievably, this is the 20th out-of-this-world Astrosaurs adventure, and all fans will want to get their hands on this bumper story! When Teggs's arch-enemy General Loki steals a time machine, the Astrosaurs have to follow him back in time to avert catastrophe... Not only does this book contain an extra-long adventure for Teggs and the crew, it also features a complete Astrosaurs Academy story as well as the collector cards that young readers love.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Stephen Cole\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781849414005\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45675014291609,"sku":"1RA9781849414005","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ab4e8e36b0e_Earth_Attack__Stephen_Cole.jpg?v=1756278773","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/earth-attack","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}